 "remarks": "This top-floor penthouse offers more space and light than your typical unit. The primary bedroom has large windows with good natural light. Window will be replaced soon. A full en-suite bath and a walk-in closet. The second bedroom sits across from a second full bath, which works well for guests, a roommate, or a home office. Hardwood floors run throughout, and the kitchen has stainless steel appliances. Washer/dryer is in-unit. Two reserved garage parking spaces are included - not easy to come by in downtown Stamford. Building Highlights: Secure entrance; Newly renovated fitness center;  Outdoor patio with grills and seating; On-site superintendent Location: A short walk to the Stamford Downtown train station, with easy access to NYC and the surrounding restaurants and shops. Excellent credit and references required. No pets. The contractors will install a new window in Primary bedroom",
